+## `PATCH /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Updates the current user's notification settings.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `bundle_email_frequency` | string | Yes | How often to receive bundled notification emails. One of `never`, `every_few_hours`, `daily`, or `weekly`. |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "bundle_email_frequency": "daily"
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
